{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1339840-scion-the-siege-of-shadow-valley-ranch","id":1339840,"title":"Scion \"The Siege of Shadow Valley Ranch\"","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-06T07:46:28-07:00","id":1339840,"title":"Scion \"The Siege of Shadow Valley Ranch\"","content":"Hello folks,<br /> <br /> We bring to you the first chapter of our Scion: Origins mini series \u201cThe Siege of Shadow Valley Ranch\u201d. We hope you enjoy!<br /> <br /> A group of workers are hired to watch over a Scion's cattle while he is away. The cattle are worth literally worth their weight in silver in which draws thieves of all kinds. Now the workers must keep the herd safe or suffer the anger of a demigod.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://twincitiebynight.podbean.com/e/episode-330-scion-the-siege-of-shadow-valley-ranch-chapter-1/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://d2bwo9zemjwxh5.cloudfront.net/ep-logo/pbblog4577585/Siege_1200x628.jpg?s=b281b357e421a24adfc8b6472f79ce4d&amp;e=jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://twincitiebynight.podbean.com/e/episode-330-scion-the-siege-of-shadow-valley-ranch-chapter-1/\" target=\"_blank\"> Scion \"The Siege of Shadow Valley Ranch\" Chapter 1: Oaths in Shadow Valley | Twin Cities by Night </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://twincitiebynight.podbean.com/e/episode-330-scion-the-siege-of-shadow-valley-ranch-chapter-1/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://twincitiebynight.podbean.com/e/episode-330-scion-the-siege-of-shadow-valley-ranch-chapter-1/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Four freshly blooded Scions roll out of Phoenix toward the middle of nowhere, trading movie quotes, bad advice, and cheap beer as desert heat shimmers around them. What waits at the end of that dusty road isn&rsquo;t glory, but work: watching over a small herd of uncanny white cattle, marked with red-tipped ears and worth their weight in silver. Kieran O&rsquo;Connor, a laid-back but clearly powerful Scion, asks Hassan, Jesse, Nick, and Gary to do something deceptively simple&mdash;keep his miraculous herd safe while he&rsquo;s away. All it takes is an oath, a handshake, and the understanding that if they fail, they&rsquo;re not just out a paycheck; they&rsquo;re in trouble with a demigod whose entire livelihood rests on those animals. As the sun drops and the Arizona sky goes indigo, the ranch becomes very small, the desert very large, and the four friends start to realize that anything valuable enough to be worth millions is also valuable enough to attract the wrong kind of attention. Out here, under a sky full of indifferent stars, they&rsquo;ll find out what it really means to be sworn protectors in a world where myths don&rsquo;t stay on the page. About the Chronicle The Siege of Shadow Valley Ranch is a Scion Second Edition story set a few months after the events of A Light Extinguished. Returning to the scorching outskirts of Phoenix, it follows Hassan, Jesse, Nick, and Gary&mdash;ordinary people turned nascent heroes&mdash;as they navigate blue-collar divinity: side gigs, strained romances, cramped budgets, and the sudden responsibility of guarding a god-touched herd. With Wen as Storyteller, and Chris, Craig, Mitch, and Slavic bringing the quartet of Scions to life, this chronicle leans into road-trip banter, workplace camaraderie, and the collision of modern Americana with living myth. It&rsquo;s a tale about promises that matter, the cost of protection, and how far you&rsquo;ll go when your word is bound by something bigger than yourself. \ud83d\udde8\ufe0f Hop into our Discord! Love the stories? Want to chat with the storyteller and players? Or maybe you're just looking for a place to geek out about tabletop roleplaying games? 